promptInstructions:
PRECISION IS PARAMOUNT. The transaction must be described with such specificity that:
   (a) The subject (specific property by registration district + survey/khasra + boundaries; specific account number; specific case number; specific contract) is identifiable;
   (b) The counterparty is named;
   (c) The consideration / value is specified or capped;
   (d) The act is clearly stated (execute and present for registration a sale deed; appear before SR for registration; sign and verify a written statement; etc.).
